### Health
GET http://localhost:7777/health

### Inspect runtime
GET http://localhost:7777/config

### Non-stream Agent run
POST http://localhost:7777/agents/support-assistant-v1/runs
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AgentBoundary

--AgentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="message"

Explain what you can help with.
--AgentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="session_id"

session_demo_001
--AgentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="stream"

false
--AgentBoundary--

### Stream with curl instead:
# curl -N -X POST http://localhost:7777/agents/support-assistant-v1/runs \
#   -F 'message=Help me troubleshoot a login issue' \
#   -F 'session_id=session_demo_001' \
#   -F 'stream=true'
#
# With auth enabled add:
#   -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT'
